{
  "key": "chain/lush-hall",
  "kind": "chain",
  "summary": "A big, lush hall reverb: long modulated tail, soft top, pre-delay so the part stays clear",
  "tags": [
    "reverb",
    "hall",
    "lush",
    "big",
    "space",
    "ambient",
    "wash",
    "cathedral",
    "pad"
  ],
  "devices": [
    "DattorroReverb"
  ],
  "links": [
    "chain/small-room",
    "chain/dub-echo"
  ],
  "checked": {
    "how": "written",
    "by": "claude (chains from the bench's gaps)",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
    "opendaw": "652e6ca"
  },
  "body": [
    "DattorroReverb (the plate/hall), 30 ms pre-delay, modulated tail (excursion) for the lush shimmer, damping so it isn't bright.",
    "amount sets the tail and level: 0 a polite hall, 3 a wash. On keys and pads; on drums keep amount ≤ 1. For a short room, chain/small-room."
  ],
  "apply": {
    "params": {
      "track": {
        "type": "track",
        "about": "the part to put it on, or master"
      },
      "amount": {
        "type": "amount"
      }
    },
    "steps": [
      {
        "op": "add_effect",
        "input": {
          "track": "$track",
          "effect": "DattorroReverb",
          "settings": [
            {
              "param": "preDelay",
              "value": 30
            },
            {
              "param": "bandwidth",
              "value": 0.75
            },
            {
              "param": "decay",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  0.7,
                  0.92
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "param": "damping",
              "value": 0.35
            },
            {
              "param": "excursionRate",
              "value": 0.5
            },
            {
              "param": "excursionDepth",
              "value": 0.8
            },
            {
              "param": "wet",
              "value": {
                "dial": [
                  -18,
                  -6
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "param": "dry",
              "value": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
